{"id":"torrey:reward-of-saints-the","source":"torrey","name":"Reward Of Saints, The","slug":"reward-of-saints-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is from God — Ro 2:7; Col 3:24; Heb 11:6.","refs":[["Rom",2,7,2,7],["Col",3,24,3,24],["Heb",11,6,11,6]]},{"text":"Is of grace, through faith alone — Ro 4:4,5,16; 11:6.","refs":[["Rom",4,4,4,4],["Rom",4,5,4,5],["Rom",4,16,4,16],["Rom",11,6,11,6]]},{"text":"Is of God’s good pleasure — Mt 20:14,15; Lu 12:32.","refs":[["Matt",20,14,20,14],["Matt",20,15,20,15],["Luke",12,32,12,32]]},{"text":"Prepared by God — Heb 11:16.","refs":[["Heb",11,16,11,16]]},{"text":"Prepared by Christ — Joh 14:2.","refs":[["John",14,2,14,2]]},{"text":"As servants of Christ — Col 3:24.","refs":[["Col",3,24,3,24]]},{"text":"Not on account of their merits — Ro 4:4,5.","refs":[["Rom",4,4,4,4],["Rom",4,5,4,5]]},{"text":"Being with Christ. — Joh 12:26; 14:3; Php 1:23; 1Th 4:17.","refs":[["John",12,26,12,26],["John",14,3,14,3],["Phil",1,23,1,23],["1Thess",4,17,4,17]]},{"text":"Beholding the face of God. — Ps 17:15; Mt 5:8; Re 22:4.","refs":[["Ps",17,15,17,15],["Matt",5,8,5,8],["Rev",22,4,22,4]]},{"text":"Beholding the glory of Christ. — Joh 17:24.","refs":[["John",17,24,17,24]]},{"text":"Being glorified with Christ. — Ro 8:17,18; Col 3:4; Php 3:21; 1Jo 3:2.","refs":[["Rom",8,17,8,17],["Rom",8,18,8,18],["Col",3,4,3,4],["Phil",3,21,3,21],["1John",3,2,3,2]]},{"text":"Sitting in judgment with Christ. — Da 7:22; Mt 19:28; Lu 22:30; 1Co 6:2.","refs":[["Dan",7,22,7,22],["Matt",19,28,19,28],["Luke",22,30,22,30],["1Cor",6,2,6,2]]},{"text":"Reigning with Christ. — 2Ti 2:12; Re 3:21; 5:10; 20:4.","refs":[["2Tim",2,12,2,12],["Rev",3,21,3,21],["Rev",5,10,5,10],["Rev",20,4,20,4]]},{"text":"Reigning for ever and ever. — Re 22:5.","refs":[["Rev",22,5,22,5]]},{"text":"A crown of righteousness. — 2Ti 4:8.","refs":[["2Tim",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"A crown of glory. — 1Pe 5:4.","refs":[["1Pet",5,4,5,4]]},{"text":"A crown of life. — Jas 1:12; Re 2:10.","refs":[["Jas",1,12,1,12],["Rev",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"An incorruptible crown. — 1Co 9:25.","refs":[["1Cor",9,25,9,25]]},{"text":"Joint heirship with Christ. — Ro 8:17.","refs":[["Rom",8,17,8,17]]},{"text":"Inheritance of all things. — Re 21:7.","refs":[["Rev",21,7,21,7]]},{"text":"Inheritance with saints in light. — Ac 20:32; 26:18; Col 1:12.","refs":[["Acts",20,32,20,32],["Acts",26,18,26,18],["Col",1,12,1,12]]},{"text":"Inheritance eternal. — Heb 9:15.","refs":[["Heb",9,15,9,15]]},{"text":"Inheritance incorruptible. — 1Pe 1:4.","refs":[["1Pet",1,4,1,4]]},{"text":"A kingdom. — Mt 25:34; Lu 22:29.","refs":[["Matt",25,34,25,34],["Luke",22,29,22,29]]},{"text":"A kingdom immovable. — Heb 12:28.","refs":[["Heb",12,28,12,28]]},{"text":"Shining as the stars. — Da 12:3.","refs":[["Dan",12,3,12,3]]},{"text":"Everlasting light. — Isa 60:19.","refs":[["Isa",60,19,60,19]]},{"text":"Everlasting life. — Lu 18:30; Joh 6:40; 17:2,3; Ro 2:7; 6:23; 1Jo 5:11.","refs":[["Luke",18,30,18,30],["John",6,40,6,40],["John",17,2,17,2],["John",17,3,17,3],["Rom",2,7,2,7],["Rom",6,23,6,23],["1John",5,11,5,11]]},{"text":"An enduring substance. — Heb 10:34.","refs":[["Heb",10,34,10,34]]},{"text":"A house eternal in the heavens. — 2Co 5:1.","refs":[["2Cor",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"A city which had foundation. — Heb 11:10.","refs":[["Heb",11,10,11,10]]},{"text":"Entering into the joy of the Lord. — Mt 25:21; Heb 12:2.","refs":[["Matt",25,21,25,21],["Heb",12,2,12,2]]},{"text":"Rest. — Heb 4:9; Re 14:13.","refs":[["Heb",4,9,4,9],["Rev",14,13,14,13]]},{"text":"Fulness of joy. — Ps 16:11.","refs":[["Ps",16,11,16,11]]},{"text":"The prize of the high calling of God in Christ. — Php 3:14.","refs":[["Phil",3,14,3,14]]},{"text":"Treasure in heaven. — Mt 19:21; Lu 12:33.","refs":[["Matt",19,21,19,21],["Luke",12,33,12,33]]},{"text":"An eternal weight of glory. — 2Co 4:17.","refs":[["2Cor",4,17,4,17]]},{"text":"Is great — Mt 5:12; Lu 6:35; Heb 10:35.","refs":[["Matt",5,12,5,12],["Luke",6,35,6,35],["Heb",10,35,10,35]]},{"text":"Is full — 2Jo 1:8.","refs":[["2John",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Is sure — Pr 11:18.","refs":[["Prov",11,18,11,18]]},{"text":"Is satisfying — Ps 17:15.","refs":[["Ps",17,15,17,15]]},{"text":"Is inestimable — Isa 64:4; 1Co 2:9.","refs":[["Isa",64,4,64,4],["1Cor",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Saints may feel confident of — Ps 73:24; Isa 25:8,9; 2Co 5:1; 2Ti 4:8.","refs":[["Ps",73,24,73,24],["Isa",25,8,25,8],["Isa",25,9,25,9],["2Cor",5,1,5,1],["2Tim",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"Hope of, a cause of rejoicing — Ro 5:2.","refs":[["Rom",5,2,5,2]]},{"text":"Be careful not to lose — 2Jo 1:8.","refs":[["2John",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Diligence. — 2Jo 1:8.","refs":[["2John",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Pressing forward. — Php 3:14.","refs":[["Phil",3,14,3,14]]},{"text":"Enduring suffering for Christ. — 2Co 4:16-18; Heb 11:26.","refs":[["2Cor",4,16,4,18],["Heb",11,26,11,26]]},{"text":"Faithfulness to death. — Re 2:10.","refs":[["Rev",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"Present afflictions not to be compared with — Ro 8:18; 2Co 5:17.","refs":[["Rom",8,18,8,18],["2Cor",5,17,5,17]]},{"text":"Shall be given at the second coming of Christ — Mt 16:27; Re 22:12.","refs":[["Matt",16,27,16,27],["Rev",22,12,22,12]]}],"refCount":97}
